    ![](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/gyungsubLee/subdev-blog-content/357e00e80429348449bcba14b5ab36c813c9d247/posts/1c3eda9b-0fe1-81c0-8042-cd1992dc52fd/155e1434fea017fe.webp)

<a id="1c3eda9b0fe181e8a5b6eb01ec0477cf"></a>

### <strong>단방향</strong>

![](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/gyungsubLee/subdev-blog-content/357e00e80429348449bcba14b5ab36c813c9d247/posts/1c3eda9b-0fe1-81c0-8042-cd1992dc52fd/c028b233829a4aa0.webp)

