### <strong>양방향</strong>

![](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/gyungsubLee/subdev-blog-content/357e00e80429348449bcba14b5ab36c813c9d247/posts/1c3eda9b-0fe1-81c0-8042-cd1992dc52fd/4603b29dcc840f4d.webp)

